ombo Per un pugno di dollari (1964). Both hired Sergio Leone to direct the film with a budget of 200.000 dollars. In 1964 they founded Jolly Film, and they produced Duello nel Texas (1963), and Ad ogni costo (1967), between others.He was member of the jury at the Cannes Film Festival in 1972.", "biography_author": "Wikidata", "date_of_biography": "2023-08-01T14:59:10.237966+10:00", "external_links": [{"id": 2123, "uri": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Giorgio_Papi"}], "uuid": "198d4c1d-d2c2-4766-951e-366950935839", "source": {"name": "Vernon", "slug": "vernon"}, "source_identifier": "19657", "external_references": [{"id": 9143, "source": {"name": "Wikidata", "slug": "wikidata"}, "source_identifier": "Q3765652"}, {"id": 9144, "source": {"name": "VIAF", "slug": "viaf"}, "source_identifier": "94228373"}, {"id": 9145, "source": {"name": "LOC Auth", "slug": "loc-auth"}, "source_identifier": "no2003059303"}, {"id": 9146, "source": {"name": "WorldCat", "slug": "worldcat"}, "source_identifier": "lccn-no2003059303"}], "date_modified": "2023-09-05T20:06:27.203653+10:00"}]}